# L §4.2: calendar(weekends [...]) lists "the weekdays (mon tue wed thu fri sat sun, ISO 8601's days 1 to 7; another
# word is refused, LOAD-PARSE)". sobota is no weekday word. (Writer 6.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input len: calendar

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026
  known 2025-12-01
  len = calendar(weekends [sobota, sun])

ask q1: is_business(2026-03-02, len)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PARSE ...
